So hit that subscribe button and that's it.

11
00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:30.577
Enjoy the conversation, "Feels Good Man".

12
00:00:37.580 --> 00:00:40.020
Welcome gentlemen, I'm super happy to have you

13
00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:40.950
guys here today.

14
00:00:40.950 --> 00:00:42.010
Very happy to be here.

15
00:00:42.010 --> 00:00:43.560
